!?FU(ES_CreateERMHook);
!!UN:P743/?i^ES_health_artifacts_enabled^ P782/?i^ES_medicine_enabled^;?(medicine:y);     [check if option 743 is enabled]

!!if|i^ES_health_artifacts_enabled^/i^ES_medicine_enabled^;
